{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天主教主教座堂追思彌撒　悼念宏福苑大火亡者\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WF-MASS-261125-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】宏福苑大火發生一周年前夕，天主教主教座堂舉行追思彌撒悼念亡者。</p><p>天主教聖母無原罪主教座堂晚上舉行追思彌撒，由神父陳志明主祭，約800人出席，為宏福苑死難者、傷者及死傷者家屬祈禱誦經。有亡者家屬分享，又由4名家屬讀出168名死者名字。彌撒歷時兩個多小時。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.850072+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:25:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:50:58.973675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:30.036256+00:00","content_hash":"41acaee25ec5c8997ff1dbe659a599ea583ec5b5065e4425234c4a416756c955","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}